  "description": "QUPMEW crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C134 H146 Eu2 N4 O26 Ti4,4(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Eu01 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Ti02 (Ti) has 6 O neighbors; Ti03 (Ti) has 6 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Ti3 (Ti) has 6 O neighbors; Ti4 (Ti) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 2.858-3.767 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.63-142.42°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Eu2Ti4(μ2-O)2(μ3-O)4(phen)2(tbza)10·4CH3CN. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ2-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
